CLKC-11#1 Advisory
MMCME4 divide could be done by BUFG_GT  
The MMCME4 cell rf_system_i/rf_clock/inst/mmcme4_adv_inst driven by BUFG_GT cell rf_system_i/rfdc/inst/i_rf_system_rfdc_0_bufg_gt_ctrl/adc2_bufg_gt uses CLKOUT* output(s) with a DIVIDE value of [1..8] which could be accomplished using a BUFG_GT divide capability. Consider using BUFG_GT(s) to accomplish the desired divide(s).
Related violations: <none>

CLKC-56#1 Advisory
MMCME4 with global clock driver has no LOC  
The MMCME4_ADV cell rf_system_i/rf_clock/inst/mmcme4_adv_inst CLKIN1 or CLKIN2 pin is driven by global Clock buffer(s) rf_system_i/rfdc/inst/i_rf_system_rfdc_0_bufg_gt_ctrl/adc2_bufg_gt and does not have a LOC constraint. It is recommended to LOC the MMCM and use the CLOCK_DEDICATED_ROUTE constraint on the net(s) driven by the global Clock buffer(s).
Related violations: <none>


